  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1237518,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1x1 Font Editor V0.9 - Commodore 64\n\nUnleash your inner pixel artist with 1x1 Font Editor V0.9, a powerful and surprisingly accessible tool for the Commodore 64! This program allows you to design and create custom character sets for your games, demos, and other creative projects. Forget limitations – craft unique fonts with a distinctive 1x1 pixel resolution, perfect for retro aesthetics and adding a personal touch to your Commodore 64 creations.\n\nThe editor boasts a clean and intuitive interface, featuring a pixel-by-pixel drawing area, color palette selection, and easy character swapping.  Experiment with different shapes, patterns, and colors to build a truly original font.  Save your creations to disk for later use, and quickly integrate them into your projects. \n\nWhile simple to learn, 1x1 Font Editor V0.9 offers surprising depth for experienced users.  Explore the nuances of pixel art and character design, and breathe new life into your Commodore 64 software.  No prior programming knowledge is required – just a passion for creativity and a desire to personalize your retro experience!"
    },
